{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7b67f306-3063-82b8-9eef-427a54d4cee8",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:58:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Antonio Resendes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:55:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:55:42-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. Yeah, I'm calling about a storm drain, you know, it's clogged up or something. I'm at 279 Washington Street, down in The Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:55:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 279 Washington. What's it doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:55:55-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, I mean, ever since the nor'easter that ended Saturday, two days ago, there's water pooled all the way across the crosswalk by the school bus stop. Right? And the kids are stepping out into the road to get around it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:56:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's not good, especially at drop-off. Is the drain itself covered over, or is it just not taking water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:56:19-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's covered, I mean, it's packed with leaves and, you know, grit and stuff. And the sidewalk is a sheet of mud and grit all along there. It washed down out of the street and just sat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:56:34-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So debris on the grate, standing water at the crosswalk, and a muddy sidewalk. Is the water still there today, or did it go down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:56:45-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's still there, it's gone down a little but it's still across the whole crosswalk. I was out there maybe twenty minutes ago. Sorry, I've got clay under my fingernails, I teach a pottery class, so I'm kind of, you know, coming straight from that. Anyway, can somebody come clean the drain? That's really what I'm asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:57:07-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll put in a work order to have the drain cleaned out. Crews are working through a pile of these after the storm, so it may take a few days, but I'll mark it as near a bus stop with kids walking in the road, which bumps it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:57:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, right, that's good. Do you need a number for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:57:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you'd like a call when it's done, sure. What's the best one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:57:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0168."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:57:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0168. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:57:43-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Antonio Resendes. R-E-S-E-N-D-E-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:57:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, Mr. Resendes. Work order's in for the drain at 279 Washington Street. If the water gets deeper or a car nearly hits someone, call us right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:57:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, will do. You got all that, the crosswalk and everything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:58:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got it all noted. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:58:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:58:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good Monday."
    }
  ],
